      "tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-9e97aba97a822ae2",
      "content": "SPEC.md (lines 1-357 of 357)\n1: # JCROWN DIGITALS — Technical Specification\n2: \n3: ## 1. Concept & Vision\n4: \n5: JCROWN DIGITALS is a premium personal-brand website for Jediah Akeredolu — a digital publications platform that feels like stepping into a private library, not a storefront. The experience is confident, intelligent, and luxurious: deep blacks contrasted with restrained gold accents create a sense of exclusivity and trust. Every interaction is purposeful; every page tells Jediah's story first, then guides visitors to his work.\n6: \n7: **Primary visitor journey:** Discover JCrown -> Learn about Jediah -> Click \"DOWNLOAD BOOKS HERE\" -> Browse and download available books.\n8: \n9: ---\n10: \n11: ## 2. Design Language\n12: \n13: ### Aesthetic Direction\n14: Inspired by luxury editorial design and premium publishing houses — think Monocle magazine meets a private members' club. Clean, spacious, authoritative.\n15: \n16: ### Color Palette\n17: | Role | Color | Hex |\n18: |------|-------|-----|\n19: | Background (primary) | Rich Black | `#0A0A0A` |\n20: | Background (secondary) | Charcoal | `#1A1A1A` |\n21: | Background (panels) | Dark Gray | `#141414` |\n22: | Accent (primary) | Royal Gold | `#C9A84C` |\n23: | Accent (hover) | Bright Gold | `#D4B85A` |\n24: | Text (primary) | Ivory | `#F5F0E8` |\n25: | Text (secondary) | Muted Ivory | `#C8C0B0` |\n26: | Text (dark bg) | White | `#FFFFFF` |\n27: | Border/Divider | Subtle Gold | `#3A3A3A` |\n28: | Success | Muted Green | `#4CAF50` |\n29: | Error | Muted Red | `#E57373` |\n30: \n31: ### Typography\n32: - **Headings:** Playfair Display (serif) — elegant, editorial authority\n33: - **Body:** Inter (sans-serif) — clean, readable, modern\n34: - **Fallbacks:** Georgia, serif / system-ui, sans-serif\n35: \n36: ### Spatial System\n37: - Base unit: 8px\n38: - Section padding: 80px–120px vertical\n39: - Container max-width: 1200px\n40: - Card gap: 32px\n41: - Border radius: 4px (subtle, not rounded)\n42: \n43: ### Motion Philosophy\n44: - Scroll-triggered fade-up reveals: 600ms ease-out\n45: - Button hover: 200ms color + subtle lift (translateY -2px)\n46: - Page transitions: none (instant, for speed)\n47: - Smooth scroll behavior with 80px offset for fixed header\n48: - Focus states: gold outline, 2px offset\n49: \n50: ### Visual Assets\n51: - Icons: Lucide icons (line style, 1.5px stroke)\n52: - Book covers: Admin-uploaded images, displayed in 3:4 ratio frames\n53: - Portrait: Admin-uploaded, displayed in subtle gold-bordered circle\n54: - Decorative: Subtle gradient overlays, fine gold dividers\n55: \n56: ---\n57: \n58: ## 3. Layout & Structure\n59: \n60: ### Public Site Structure\n61: ```\n62: / (Homepage)\n63:   ├── Navigation (fixed, transparent → solid on scroll)\n64:   ├── Hero (100vh, centered, book mockup visual)\n65:   ├── About Jediah (two-column: portrait + text)\n66:   ├── What JCROWN Offers (three feature cards)\n67:   ├── Download CTA (centered gold button)\n68:   ├── Books Section (#books, card grid)\n69:   ├── Newsletter (centered subscription)\n70:   ├── Contact (two-column: info + form)\n71:   └── Footer (minimal, links)\n72: ```\n73: \n74: ### Admin Structure\n75: ```\n76: /admin\n77:   ├── Login\n78:   └── Dashboard\n79:       ├── Overview (stats)\n80:       ├── Books Management (CRUD)\n81:       ├── Homepage Content Editor\n82:       ├── Subscriber Management\n83:       └── Contact Messages\n84: ```\n85: \n86: ### Responsive Strategy\n87: - Desktop: 1200px container, multi-column layouts\n88: - Tablet (768px): 2-column grids, adjusted spacing\n89: - Mobile (480px): single column, full-width cards, hamburger nav\n90: \n91: ---\n92: \n93: ## 4. Features & Interactions\n94: \n95: ### Navigation\n96: - Fixed header, 70px height, transitions from transparent to `#0A0A0A` on scroll\n97: - Logo left, nav links right\n98: - Mobile: hamburger menu, full-screen overlay\n99: - Active section highlighting via scroll spy\n100: - Smooth scroll to anchors with 80px offset\n101: \n102: ### Hero Section\n103: - Full viewport height\n104: - Centered content: wordmark, welcome text, quote\n105: - Subtle animated book stack or floating eBook covers\n106: - Scroll indicator (chevron) at bottom\n107: \n108: ### About Section\n109: - Two columns: portrait (40%) + bio text (60%)\n110: - Gold divider line between portrait and text\n111: - Editable text via admin\n112: \n113: ### What We Offer\n114: - Three cards in a row (stacked on mobile)\n115: - Each: icon, heading, short description\n116: - Subtle hover: lift + gold border glow\n117: \n118: ### Download CTA Button\n119: - Large gold button, centered\n120: - Label: \"DOWNLOAD BOOKS HERE\"\n121: - Links to `#books` with smooth scroll + 80px offset\n122: - Keyboard accessible, visible focus/hover states\n123: \n124: ### Books Section (#books)\n125: - Grid of book cards\n126: - Each card: cover image, title, description, author, format badge, price label, action button\n127: - Free books: \"Download Free\" button → direct file download (no login required)\n128: - Paid books: \"Get This Book\" → checkout flow (Stripe or placeholder)\n129: - Empty state: \"New publications are coming soon\" message\n130: - Only published books shown\n131: \n132: ### Newsletter Section\n133: - Email input + \"Subscribe for Updates\" button\n134: - Client + server validation (valid email format)\n135: - Success: \"Thank you for subscribing!\" message\n136: - Error: specific error message displayed\n137: - Stores subscribers in database\n138: \n139: ### Contact Section\n140: - Fields: Name, Email, Subject, Message\n141: - Client + server validation\n142: - Success: \"Message sent successfully\" + form reset\n143: - Error: \"Failed to send. Please try again.\"\n144: - Stores messages in database\n145: \n146: ### Footer\n147: - Brand name, copyright\n148: - Quick links (scroll to sections)\n149: - Privacy Policy, Terms pages\n150: - Social links (configurable in admin)\n151: \n152: ---\n153: \n154: ## 5. Component Inventory\n155: \n156: ### Button (Primary)\n157: - Default: Gold `#C9A84C` bg, black text, 4px radius\n158: - Hover: Lighter gold `#D4B85A`, translateY(-2px), subtle shadow\n159: - Active: Darker gold, translateY(0)\n160: - Disabled: 50% opacity, no pointer\n161: - Focus: 2px gold outline, 2px offset\n162: \n163: ### Button (Secondary/Ghost)\n164: - Default: Transparent bg, gold border, gold text\n165: - Hover: Gold bg at 10% opacity\n166: - Focus: Gold outline\n167: \n168: ### Book Card\n169: - Dark panel `#141414`, subtle border\n170: - Cover image (3:4), title, description (2-line clamp), format badge, price\n171: - Hover: border brightens to gold, subtle lift\n172: - Action button at bottom\n173: \n174: ### Input Field\n175: - Dark bg `#1A1A1A`, subtle border\n176: - Focus: gold border, no outline\n177: - Error: red border + error message below\n178: - Placeholder: muted ivory\n179: \n180: ### Navigation Link\n181: - Default: ivory text\n182: - Hover: gold text, no underline\n183: - Active: gold text, subtle underline\n184: \n185: ---\n186: \n187: ## 6. Technical Approach\n188: \n189: ### Stack\n190: - **Runtime:** Node.js 18+\n191: - **Framework:** Express.js\n192: - **Template Engine:** EJS\n193: - **Database:** SQLite (better-sqlite3 for sync operations)\n194: - **File Storage:** Local filesystem (`/public/uploads/`)\n195: - **Authentication:** Express sessions + bcrypt\n196: - **Payments:** Stripe (optional, configured via env)\n197: \n198: ### API Design\n199: \n200: #### Public\n201: | Method | Route | Description |\n202: |--------|-------|-------------|\n203: | GET | `/` | Homepage |\n204: | GET | `/admin` | Admin login page |\n205: | POST | `/admin/login` | Authenticate admin |\n206: | POST | `/admin/logout` | End session |\n207: | POST | `/api/subscribe` | Newsletter signup |\n208: | POST | `/api/contact` | Submit contact form |\n209: | GET | `/api/books` | List published books |\n210: | GET | `/download/:bookId` | Download free book file |\n211: \n212: #### Admin (protected)\n213: | Method | Route | Description |\n214: |--------|-------|-------------|\n215: | GET | `/admin/dashboard` | Dashboard overview |\n216: | GET | `/admin/books` | Book management list |\n217: | POST | `/admin/books` | Create book |\n218: | PUT | `/admin/books/:id` | Update book |\n219: | DELETE | `/admin/books/:id` | Delete book |\n220: | PUT | `/admin/content` | Update homepage content |\n221: | GET | `/admin/subscribers` | View subscribers |\n222: | DELETE | `/admin/subscribers/:id` | Unsubscribe |\n223: | GET | `/admin/messages` | View contact messages |\n224: | PUT | `/admin/settings` | Update site settings |\n225: \n226: ### Data Model\n227: \n228: #### books\n229: - id (INTEGER PRIMARY KEY)\n230: - title (TEXT)\n231: - description (TEXT)\n232: - author (TEXT, default \"Jediah Akeredolu\")\n233: - cover_image (TEXT, filepath)\n234: - file_path (TEXT, filepath)\n235: - file_format (TEXT, e.g. \"PDF\")\n236: - price (REAL, 0 for free)\n237: - is_free (INTEGER, 0/1)\n238: - is_published (INTEGER, 0/1)\n239: - download_count (INTEGER, default 0)\n240: - created_at (DATETIME)\n241: - updated_at (DATETIME)\n242: \n243: #### subscribers\n244: - id (INTEGER PRIMARY KEY)\n245: - email (TEXT UNIQUE)\n246: - is_active (INTEGER, default 1)\n247: - subscribed_at (DATETIME)\n248: - unsubscribed_at (DATETIME)\n249: \n250: #### contacts\n251: - id (INTEGER PRIMARY KEY)\n252: - name (TEXT)\n253: - email (TEXT)\n254: - subject (TEXT)\n255: - message (TEXT)\n256: - is_read (INTEGER, default 0)\n257: - created_at (DATETIME)\n258: \n259: #### admin_users\n260: - id (INTEGER PRIMARY KEY)\n261: - username (TEXT UNIQUE)\n262: - password_hash (TEXT)\n263: - created_at (DATETIME)\n264: \n265: #### site_content\n266: - id (INTEGER PRIMARY KEY)\n267: - section (TEXT, e.g. \"hero\", \"about\", \"offers\")\n268: - content (TEXT, JSON)\n269: - updated_at (DATETIME)\n270: \n271: ### Authentication\n272: - Session-based with `express-session`\n273: - Bcrypt password hashing (cost factor 12)\n274: - Session stored in SQLite\n275: - Protected routes check session admin flag\n276: - CSRF protection on forms\n277: \n278: ### File Handling\n279: - Multer for upload middleware\n280: - Allowed extensions: .jpg, .jpeg, .png, .gif, .webp (covers); .pdf, .epub, .mobi (books)\n281: - Max file size: 10MB covers, 50MB books\n282: - Files stored in `/public/uploads/covers/` and `/public/uploads/books/`\n283: - Filenames sanitized with UUID\n284: \n285: ### Security\n286: - Input sanitization on all user inputs\n287: - Parameterized queries (no raw SQL interpolation)\n288: - XSS prevention via EJS escaping\n289: - CSRF tokens on all forms\n290: - Rate limiting on contact/subscribe endpoints\n291: - Secure password requirements for admin\n292: \n293: ---\n294: \n295: ## 7. Pages & States\n296: \n297: ### Homepage\n298: - All 9 sections visible\n299: - Books section shows published books or empty state\n300: - Navigation highlights current section\n301: \n302: ### Book Detail (inline in grid)\n303: - Card shows all info\n304: - Click download: triggers file download for free books\n305: - Click purchase: opens checkout or payment modal\n306: \n307: ### Admin Login\n308: - Username + password fields\n309: - Error states for invalid credentials\n310: - Redirect to dashboard on success\n311: \n312: ### Admin Dashboard\n313: - Stats cards: total books, subscribers, messages, downloads\n314: - Quick actions: Add Book, Edit Content, View Messages\n315: \n316: ### Book Management\n317: - Table of all books (published + draft)\n318: - Add/Edit modal or page\n319: - Upload cover + file\n320: - Toggle free/paid, published status\n321: \n322: ### Empty States\n323: - No books: \"New publications are coming soon\"\n324: - No subscribers: \"No subscribers yet\"\n325: - No messages: \"No messages yet\"\n326: \n327: ---\n328: \n329: ## 8. SEO & Metadata\n330: \n331: - Title: \"JCROWN DIGITALS — Jediah Akeredolu\"\n332: - Description: \"Discover digital publications and resources by Jediah Akeredolu. Explore books, access free resources, and stay updated with JCROWN DIGITALS.\"\n333: - OG tags for social sharing\n334: - Semantic HTML (header, main, section, article, footer)\n335: - Canonical URL\n336: \n337: ---\n338: \n339: ## 9. Setup & Deployment\n340: \n341: ### Requirements\n342: - Node.js 18+\n343: - npm\n344: \n345: ### Installation\n346: ```bash\n347: npm install\n348: npm run setup    # Creates admin user, DB tables\n349: npm start        # Runs on http://localhost:3000\n350: ```\n351: \n352: ### Environment Variables\n353: - `SESSION_SECRET` — session encryption key\n354: - `ADMIN_USERNAME` — default admin username\n355: - `ADMIN_PASSWORD` — default admin password\n356: - `STRIPE_KEY` — Stripe API key (optional)\n357: "
    },
