        "args": "{\"path\": \"SPEC.md\"}",
        "result": "SPEC.md (lines 1-357 of 357)\n1: # JCROWN DIGITALS — Technical Specification\n2: \n3: ## 1. Concept & Vision\n4: \n5: JCROWN DIGITALS is a premium personal-brand website for Jediah Akeredolu — a digital publications platform that feels like stepping into a private library, not a storefront. The experience is confident, intelligent, and luxurious: deep blacks contrasted with restrained gold accents create a sense of exclusivity and trust. Every interaction is purposeful; every page tells Jediah's story first, then guides visitors to his work.\n6: \n7: **Primary visitor journey:** Discover JCrown -> Learn about Jediah -> Click \"DOWNLOAD BOOKS HERE\" -> Browse and download available books.\n8: \n9: ---\n10: \n11: ## 2. Design Language\n12: \n13: ### Aesthetic Direction\n14: Inspired by luxury editorial design and premium publishing houses — think Monocle magazine meets a private members' club. Clean, spacious, authoritative.\n15: \n16: ### Color Palette\n17: | Role | Color | Hex |\n18: |------|-------|-----|\n19: | Background (primary) | Rich Black | `#0A0A0A` |\n20: | Background (secondary) | Charcoal | `#1A1A1A` |\n21: | Background (panels) | Dark Gray | `#141414` |\n22: | Accent (primary) | Royal Gold | `#C9A84C` |\n23: | Accent (hover) | Bright Gold | `#D4B85A` |\n24: | Text (primary) | Ivory | `#F5F0E8` |\n25: | Text (secondary) | Muted Ivory | `#C8C0B0` |\n26: | Text (dark bg) | White | `#FFFFFF` |\n27: | Border/Divider | Subtle Gold | `#3A3A3A` |\n28: | Success | Muted Green | `#4CAF50` |\n29: | Error | Muted Red | `#E57373` |\n30: \n31: ### Typography\n32: - **Headings:** Playfair Display (serif) — elegant, editorial authority\n33: - **Body:** Inter (sans-serif) — clean, readable, modern\n34: - **Fallbacks:** Georgia, serif / system-ui, sans-serif\n35: \n36: ### Spatial System\n37: - Base unit: 8px\n38: - Section padding: 80px–120px vertical\n39: - Container max-width: 1200px\n40: - Card gap: 32px\n41: - Border radius: 4px (subtle, not rounded)\n42: \n43: ### Motion Philosophy\n44: - Scroll-triggered fade-up reveals: 600ms ease-out\n45: - Button hover: 200ms color + subtle lift (translateY -2px)\n46: - Page transitions: none (instant, for speed)\n47: - Smooth scroll behavior with 80px offset for fixed header\n48: - Focus states: gold outline, 2px offset\n49: \n50: ### Visual Assets\n51: - Icons: Lucide icons (line style, 1.5px stroke)\n52: - Book covers: Admin-uploaded images, displayed in 3:4 ratio frames\n53: - Portrait: Admin-uploaded, displayed in subtle gold-bordered circle\n54: - Decorative: Subtle gradient overlays, fine gold dividers\n55: \n56: ---\n57: \n58: ## 3. Layout & Structure\n59: \n60: ### Public Site Structure\n61: ```\n62: / (Homepage)\n63:   ├── Navigation (fixed, transparent → solid on scroll)\n64:   ├── Hero (100vh, centered, book mockup visual)\n65:   ├── About Jediah (two-column: portrait + text)\n66:   ├── What JCROWN Offers (three feature cards)\n67:   ├── Download CTA (centered gold button)\n68:   ├── Books Section (#books, card grid)\n69:   ├── Newsletter (centered subscription)\n70:   ├── Contact (two-column: info + form)\n71:   └── Footer (minimal, links)\n72: ```\n73: \n74: ### Admin Structure\n75: ```\n76: /admin\n77:   ├── Login\n78:   └── Dashboard\n79:       ├── Overview (stats)\n80:       ├── Books Management (CRUD)\n81:       ├── Homepage Content Editor\n82:       ├── Subscriber Management\n83:       └── Contact Messages\n84: ```\n85: \n86: ### Responsive Strategy\n87: - Desktop: 1200px container, multi-column layouts\n88: - Tablet (768px): 2-column grids, adjusted spacing\n89: - Mobile (480px): single column, full-width cards, hamburger nav\n90: \n91: ---\n92: \n93: ## 4. Features & Interactions\n94: \n95: ### Navigation\n96: - Fixed header, 70px height, transitions from transparent to `#0A0A0A` on scroll\n97: - Logo left, nav links right\n98: - Mobile: hamburger menu, full-screen overlay\n99: - Active section highlighting via scroll spy\n100: - Smooth scroll to anchors with 80px offset\n101: \n102: ### Hero Section\n103: - Full viewport height\n104: - Centered content: wordmark, welcome text, quote\n105: - Subtle animated book stack or floating eBook covers\n106: - Scroll indicator (chevron) at bottom\n107: \n108: ### About Section\n109: - Two columns: portrait (40%) + bio text (60%)\n110: - Gold divider line between portrait and text\n111: - Editable text via admin\n112: \n113: ### What We Offer\n114: - Three cards in a row (stacked on mobile)\n115: - Each: icon, heading, short description\n116: - Subtle hover: lift + gold border glow\n117: \n118: ### Download CTA Button\n119: - Large gold button, centered\n120: - Label: \"DOWNLOAD BOOKS HERE\"\n121: - Links to `#books` with smooth scroll + 80px offset\n122: - Keyboard accessible, visible focus/hover states\n123: \n124: ### Books Section (#books)\n125: - Grid of book cards\n126: - Each card: cover image, title, description, author, format badge, price label, action button\n127: - Free books: \"Download Free\" button → direct file download (no login required)\n128: - Paid books: \"Get This Book\" → checkout flow (Stripe or placeholder)\n129: - Empty state: \"New publications are coming soon\" message\n130: - Only published books shown\n131: \n132: ### Newsletter Section\n133: - Email input + \"Subscribe for Updates\" button\n134: - Client + server validation (valid email format)\n135: - Success: \"Thank you for subscribing!\" message\n136: - Error: specific error message displayed\n137: - Stores subscribers in database\n138: \n139: ### Contact Section\n140: - Fields: Name, Email, Subject, Message\n141: - Client + server validation\n142: - Success: \"Message sent successfully\" + form reset\n143: - Error: \"Failed to send. Please try again.\"\n144: - Stores messages in database\n145: \n146: ### Footer\n147: - Brand name, copyright\n148: - Quick links (scroll to sections)\n149: - Privacy Policy, Terms pages\n150: - Social links (configurable in admin)\n151: \n152: ---\n153: \n154: ## 5. Component Inventory\n155: \n156: ### Button (Primary)\n157: - Default: Gold `#C9A84C` bg, black text, 4px radius\n158: - Hover: Lighter gold `#D4B85A`, translateY(-2px), subtle shadow\n",
        "ok": true
      }
