        "result": "index.html:9: content=\"Discover digital publications and resources by Jediah Akeredolu. Explore books, access free resources, and stay updated with JCROWN DIGITALS.\"\nindex.html:14: content=\"Discover digital publications and resources by Jediah Akeredolu. Explore books, access free resources, and stay updated.\"\nPROGRESS.md:27: **Request:** # JCROWN DIGITALS — PREMIUM BLACK & GOLD PERSONAL BRAND WEBSITE Act as a senior UI/UX designer, personal-brand copywriter, and full-stack web developer. Build a beautiful, modern, fully functional personal-brand landing page fo\nPROGRESS.md:62: - Build database schema (books, subscribers, contacts, admin)\nPROGRESS.md:79: - `mkdir -p public/css public/js public/uploads/covers public/uploads/books views/partials routes db` (exit 1)\nPROGRESS.md:80: - `New-Item -ItemType Directory -Force -Path public, public/css, public/js, public/uploads, public/uploads/covers, public/uploads/books, views, views/partials, routes, db` (exit 0)\nPROGRESS.md:86: - Build database schema (books, subscribers, contacts, admin)\nPROGRESS.md:108: - Build database schema (books, subscribers, contacts, admin)\nPROGRESS.md:135: - Build site sections (hero, about, books, contact, etc.)\nPROGRESS.md:157: - Build site sections (hero, about, books, contact, etc.)\nPROGRESS.md:179: - Build site sections (hero, about, books, contact, etc.)\nPROGRESS.md:203: - Build site sections (hero, about, books, contact, etc.)\nPROGRESS.md:231: - `Navbar`, `Hero`, `About`, `Offers`, `DownloadCTA`, `Books`, `Newsletter`, `Contact`, `Footer`\nPROGRESS.md:241: | P0 | Build all 9 page sections (Navbar, Hero, About, Offers, DownloadCTA, Books, Newsletter, Contact, Footer) | Missing |\nPROGRESS.md:242: | P0 | Connect Supabase: create tables (books, subscribers, contacts) and wire up forms | Not done |\nPROGRESS.md:243: | P1 | Admin portal for managing books and viewing messages/subscribers | Not built |\nPROGRESS.md:250: 2. Create SQL schema in Supabase for `books`, `subscribers`, `contacts` tables\nSPEC.md:7: **Primary visitor journey:** Discover JCrown -> Learn about Jediah -> Click \"DOWNLOAD BOOKS HERE\" -> Browse and download available books.\nSPEC.md:68: ├── Books Section (#books, card grid)\nSPEC.md:80: ├── Books Management (CRUD)\nSPEC.md:120: - Label: \"DOWNLOAD BOOKS HERE\"\nSPEC.md:121: - Links to `#books` with smooth scroll + 80px offset\nSPEC.md:124: ### Books Section (#books)\nSPEC.md:127: - Free books: \"Download Free\" button → direct file download (no login required)\nSPEC.md:128: - Paid books: \"Get This Book\" → checkout flow (Stripe or placeholder)\nSPEC.md:130: - Only published books shown\nSPEC.md:209: | GET | `/api/books` | List published books |\nSPEC.md:216: | GET | `/admin/books` | Book management list |\nSPEC.md:217: | POST | `/admin/books` | Create book |\nSPEC.md:218: | PUT | `/admin/books/:id` | Update book |\nSPEC.md:219: | DELETE | `/admin/books/:id` | Delete book |\nSPEC.md:228: #### books\nSPEC.md:280: - Allowed extensions: .jpg, .jpeg, .png, .gif, .webp (covers); .pdf, .epub, .mobi (books)\nSPEC.md:281: - Max file size: 10MB covers, 50MB books\nSPEC.md:282: - Files stored in `/public/uploads/covers/` and `/public/uploads/books/`\nSPEC.md:299: - Books section shows published books or empty state\nSPEC.md:304: - Click download: triggers file download for free books\nSPEC.md:313: - Stats cards: total books, subscribers, messages, downloads\nSPEC.md:317: - Table of all books (published + draft)\nSPEC.md:323: - No books: \"New publications are coming soon\"\nSPEC.md:332: - Description: \"Discover digital publications and resources by Jediah Akeredolu. Explore books, access free resources, and stay updated with JCROWN DIGITALS.\"\nsrc/App.jsx:6: import Books from './components/Books.jsx'\nsrc/App.jsx:20: <Books />\nsrc/lib/content.js:28: \"Explore Jediah's digital books and access available resources through the website.\",\nsrc/lib/content.js:33: 'Explore books published by Jediah — written with care and delivered in clean, readable digital formats.',\nsrc/lib/content.js:45: 'Stay informed about new books, resources, and other updates from JCROWN DIGITALS.',\nsrc/lib/content.js:51: export const books = {\nsrc/lib/content.js:52: title: 'Explore & Download My Books',\nsrc/lib/content.js:60: 'Get updates when new books, publications, and resources become available.',\nsrc/lib/supabase.js:8: * The site renders fully without Supabase; books/forms just degrade gracefully.",
