 - Max file size: 10MB covers, 50MB books\n282: - Files stored in `/public/uploads/covers/` and `/public/uploads/books/`\n283: - Filenames sanitized with UUID\n284: \n285: ### Security\n286: - Input sanitization on all user inputs\n287: - Parameterized queries (no raw SQL interpolation)\n288: - XSS prevention via EJS escaping\n289: - CSRF tokens on all forms\n290: - Rate limiting on contact/subscribe endpoints\n291: - Secure password requirements for admin\n292: \n293: ---\n294: \n295: ## 7. Pages & States\n296: \n297: ### Homepage\n298: - All 9 sections visible\n299: - Books section shows published books or empty state\n300: - Navigation highlights current section\n301: \n302: ### Book Detail (inline in grid)\n303: - Card shows all info\n304: - Click download: triggers file download for free books\n305: - Click purchase: opens checkout or payment modal\n306: \n307: ### Admin Login\n308: - Username + password fields\n309: - Error states for invalid credentials\n310: - Redirect to dashboard on success",
